      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If everyone on VRChat sets thier height in that manner, how wrong would they really be? \n\nI think for humanoid heads, using the eyes instead of top of head just means relatively taller. \n\nI think measuring the top of the avatar head using the 3d model would have difficultly on optimized model, the top of model could be hair or a hat, or hair a hat and a hoodie...",
