  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've seen a good number of my friends recently scaling their avatar using the new avatar scaling feature and saying, \"Look, I scaled my self to my real height.\" \n\n.. Except they didn't. Because they are using the VR Chat number on avatar scaling thinking that's the height they set themselves too, when in reality it's the height they set their view ball too, not their actual avatar height, which would be where the top of their head is.",
